00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:43.680
MARK MANDEL: Welcome
to Scaling Mobile Games

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:47.620
to a Global Audience using App
Engine and Cloud Datastore.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:50.980
Possibly the longest
title here at this event.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:52.530
You could probably
also rename this

00:01:52.530 --> 00:01:54.900
